Author: CusDeb OS Team
Description: Close Start Menu on global unfocus via WM_ACTIVATEAPP timer.
 Use a short timer after WM_ACTIVATEAPP(wParam=0) to verify the real
 foreground window and cancel the menu only if focus moved outside the
 menu hierarchy. Also fix CComPtr::operator& assertion in
 _IsSubMenuParent by using a temporary CComPtr.
Last-Modified: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 15:00:00 +0300

